      "text": "**Initiating Research in Korean**\n\nI\u0027ve initiated targeted Korean Google searches to identify current trends and key terminology in artificial intelligence. My queries, like \"인공지능학,\" are aimed at uncovering relevant abstract structures. This preliminary research will inform subsequent analysis and provide a robust foundation for my investigation.\n\n\n**Refining Search Queries**\n\nI\u0027m now refining my Korean Google searches to target recent AI trends and terminology. Queries now include \"인공지능학 회 최신 연구 동향,\" \"인공지능 논문 초록 예시,\" \"최신 인공지능 기술 용어,\" and \"인공지능 발전 동향 2024.\" I\u0027ll analyze these results to understand common terms, abstract formats, and significant advancements, preparing to draft a conference abstract using your specific study details.\n\n\n",
